    {
      "text": "beware of pride, D&C 23:1 (25:14; 38:39). proud shall be as stubble, D&C 29:9 (64:24; 133:64). be not proud in heart, D&C 42:40. one man not to possess that which is above another, D&C 49:20. Ezra Thayre must repent of pride, D&C 56:8. bishop to administer to wants of poor by humbling rich and proud, D&C 84:112. cease from all pride and light-mindedness, D&C 88:121. pride brings snare upon souls, D&C 90:17. many in Church at Kirtland do not forsake pride, D&C 98:20. he who exalts himself shall be abased, D&C 101:42. the Spirit is grieved when men undertake to gratify their pride, D&C 121:37.",
